function HTW_Objects_Initialize takes nothing returns nothing
    // Standard object rawcodes used by the MCP-native MVP.  Custom object
    // definitions remain an independent typed map-component concern.
    // hfoo is the deterministic neutral-hostile base creep, Hpal is the
    // placeholder hero, and hhou is the visible personal War Camp marker.
endfunction

function HTW_Regions_Initialize takes nothing returns nothing
    // The composer emits this profile-specific registry from typed region
    // data. MVP and six-team profiles therefore share one runtime path.
    call HTW_Regions_InitializeProfile()
endfunction

function HTW_Content_Abilities takes nothing returns nothing
    // Standard placeholder hero abilities are intentionally left unchanged in
    // the MVP.  Custom ability definitions are supplied by typed object data.
endfunction

function HTW_Content_Items takes nothing returns nothing
    // Item catalog hook.  Purchase records are player-owned and are handled
    // by systems.economy; no shared team wallet is introduced here.
endfunction

// Module marker for the generated map entry point.
function HTW_MCP_MainModule takes nothing returns nothing
endfunction
